            "value": "Fills in only a unique title/alias match for works awaiting a choice; multiple matches stay unchosen. Even with matching titles, check the author and edition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只切换作品检索、榜单和公开资料。备用接口由第三方提供；账号授权和进度同步始终使用 Bangumi 官方接口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
