    "返回": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还会把相似度达到阈值的标题、去掉括号副标题后相同的标题，以及自动关联到同一追踪站条目的作品算作重复。数字（季数、卷数）不同，或只是在另一个标题后追加内容（多为续作、外传）的不会模糊匹配。阈值越低结果越多，也越容易误判。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Titles at least this similar, titles equal once bracketed subtitles are dropped, and entries automatically matched to the same tracking-site entry also count. Titles with different numbers (seasons, volumes), or that only add to another title (usually sequels or spin-offs), never match fuzzily. A lower threshold finds more, with more false matches."
          }
        }
      }
    },
